'''Kotarō''' (Japanese: '''コタロウ''') is a [[Warlord]] in [[Pokémon Conquest]].

==In the games==
[[File:Ransei Ninja Warlords.png|thumb|right|250px|The ninja Warlords, Kotarō, [[Hanzō]], [[Nene]], and [[Kunoichi]] with Pokémon]]
{{Spoilers}}

===Warlord information===
When Kotarō enters a battle, there is a chance that a wild {{p|Zorua}} may appear, disguised as a duplicate of one of the wild Pokémon shown in the battle preview. This is the only way for wild Zorua to spawn without the use of {{DL|Pokémon Conquest|passwords}}.

