Kotarō is based on the real-life {{wp|Fūma Kotarō}} of Japanese history. [[Isuke]] ({{jwp|風魔小太郎#概要|Ninokuruwa Isuke}}) was of the Fūma clan as well. Kotarō served both [[Ujimasa]] ({{wp|Hōjō Ujimasa}}) and [[Ujinao]] ({{wp|Hōjō Ujinao}}).

